          "explanation": "Text support."
        },
        {
          "id": "g6-eng-unit-01-reading-lit-01-theme-lq04",
          "type": "short_answer",
          "question": "How do you identify a theme?",
          "answer": "Look at what the characters learn or how conflicts resolve.",
          "explanation": "Inferring theme."
        },
